  "selection_rationale": "Model selection is governed strictly by the validation stage (2011-06-10). While the 16-feature Expanded model yields slight statistical gains in validation ROC-AUC (+0.0053) and Brier score (-0.0011), it offers negligible practical improvement in validation CRM queue prioritization (e.g., only 3 additional non-repeaters captured under Risk-first at 10% capacity, and 7 under Hybrid, while capturing \u00a3768.8k less historical spend under Value-aware). The simpler 3-feature RFM Baseline is recommended as the default operational model for parsimony and maintainability, retaining the Expanded model as an analytical challenger."
